{"title":"2001 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/8/d78b9754fecb3ee052429372f233ee6214f9a879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 100 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 65 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 80 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 70 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/0728bebb477a2636300c56851b6a6f9e382c1b83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ACB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/23386faeefe37629243fa264877b288499db5048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BCD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> form a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Straight_angle\" title=\"Straight angle\">straight angle</a> from the diagram, allowing us to create an equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/8198bdc6a0ab59ba665b2a4bb0c21d7393480027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ACB + m\\angle BCD = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"220\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/16608992d8b81f35f24a530a64d58311008ab747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ACB + 130 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b6a4ef478aa74f8ee72b78b337ecf48b747c7bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ACB = 50^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We also notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/2640b1d07f3cf3582c7e75d4ed93b1eb8949cea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CAB = m\\angle ACB = 50^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"219\" height=\"15\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb71d5ba363a314c0343efdd9a19aafe8070c75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = BC$\" width=\"81\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The sum of the measures of the interior angles in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. Using triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/ceb8638b698f18eb8aa2d1d3665233fc4e98b3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + m\\angle CAB + m\\angle ACB = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"251\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd7b59e57a5f1850a75725d50bf92453a52f38c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 50 + 50 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56066e80011315b18b0c4e40f6c1989bb96f58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 100 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/a/ceac0d045a83d25ef58001781fb5582e690668be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"101\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195328\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 685/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2866/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.483      1 -total\n 79.82%    5.973      2 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32885:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195328 and revision id 253545. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}